Our own models — licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.

Files in this directory are models we drew ourselves, from the figures in the
brand's public datasheet and technical drawings. They are not copied or
converted from the brand's own CAD files. Dimensions are facts, so the model we
build from them is our work.

Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
(CC BY-SA 4.0). Full text: LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt at the repository root.

Next to each model, a `.checks.csv` file lists every dimension, the datasheet
page it came from, and whether it matched. That list is the record of how the
model was made.

The brand's name, logos and part numbers are their trademarks and are not
covered by this licence. Our models carry no logos or brand text. See the
repository root LICENSE and TRADEMARKS.md.
